      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "TOOLS",
      "narration_text": "Then I learned what each piece does. Claude Code runs the commands and writes the scene code. Kokoro makes the voice, on my own laptop, for free. Remotion and Manim draw every graphic from code, and eff eff em peg stitches the beats into one film.",
